# HyperFrames lab — keep authored SOURCE + docs; exclude renders, generated media,
# vendored libraries, and staged assets (all reproducible from the source + scripts).
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
# vendored geo libs (d3 / topojson / us-atlas / world-atlas) — re-download via curl
vendor/
# renders, verification stills, snapshot grids
out/
snapshots/
renders/
# staged / generated media dirs
**/assets/
**/inputs/
**/public/
**/capture/assets/
# per-render Manim run bundles (nolan.mathanim) — one timestamped directory per render,
# holding generated sources, Tex intermediates and the run's own evidence. Regenerable from
# the scene spec; the CLIP it produces is content-addressed under assets/math/ and already
# ignored above. Keep them on disk to inspect, out of the history.
**/capture/_math/
node_modules/
_batch.jsonl
audio_engine_meta.json
